WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:10.670
Target reading. Six keys to comprehension level one. Published by Cosmos Culture Limited.

2
00:00:10.670 --> 00:00:29.060
One. Have you seen this? Pen Pineapple Apple Pen.

3
00:00:29.060 --> 00:00:36.060
If this sounds familiar, you've probably seen one of Asia's biggest viral videos of 2016.

4
00:00:36.060 --> 00:00:43.060
The song PPAP by Japanese star Picotaro was watched and shared by millions of people.

5
00:00:43.060 --> 00:00:47.060
It became an overnight success thanks to social media.

6
00:00:47.060 --> 00:00:51.060
These days, YouTube videos can spread around the globe within hours.

7
00:00:51.060 --> 00:00:56.060
A video goes viral if it gets more than 5 million hits in a week.

8
00:00:56.060 --> 00:01:01.060
Some videos grab the public's attention for a few days and then disappear.

9
00:01:01.060 --> 00:01:04.060
Others stay popular for years.

10
00:01:04.060 --> 00:01:08.060
In 2007, YouTube was just beginning.

11
00:01:08.060 --> 00:01:11.060
A user uploaded a clip called Dramatic Chipmunk.

12
00:01:11.060 --> 00:01:17.060
In the video, we hear thunder, and then the animal turns to the camera looking shocked.

13
00:01:17.060 --> 00:01:21.060
Viewers of all ages and nationalities found it funny.

14
00:01:21.060 --> 00:01:27.060
The video lasts only six seconds, but the little chipmunk is still well known today.

15
00:01:27.060 --> 00:01:31.060
Music videos usually get the most hits.

16
00:01:31.060 --> 00:01:36.060
Gangnam Style was the first video to reach a billion views back in 2012.

17
00:01:36.060 --> 00:01:40.060
It took Korean singer Psy five months to reach that total.

18
00:01:40.060 --> 00:01:43.060
Now there are lots of videos with a billion views.

19
00:01:43.060 --> 00:01:49.060
Justin Bieber, Taylor Swift, and Katy Perry regularly attract huge audiences.

20
00:01:49.060 --> 00:01:52.060
Do you want to watch the top viral videos right now?

21
00:01:52.060 --> 00:01:55.060
Click the trending button on YouTube.

22
00:01:55.060 --> 00:01:59.060
It will show you the most popular clips by number of viewers.

23
00:01:59.060 --> 00:02:02.060
And if you want to make a world-famous video yourself,

24
00:02:02.060 --> 00:02:05.060
experts say you need to do two things.

25
00:02:05.060 --> 00:02:10.060
The first is to find an unusual phrase that people can remember and like to repeat.

26
00:02:10.060 --> 00:02:12.060
The second is to create emotion.

27
00:02:12.060 --> 00:02:15.060
If you can make someone laugh, cry, or get mad,

28
00:02:15.060 --> 00:02:18.060
he or she will be more likely to click Share.
